#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_PokemonLeague_1F/scripts.inc:122
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_PokemonLeague_1F_Text_MustHaveAllGymBadges"
msgid ""
"Beyond this point, only those TRAINERS\n"
"who have collected all the GYM BADGES\l"
"are permitted to enter.\p"
"TRAINER, let us confirm that you have\n"
"all the GYM BADGES.$"
msgstr ""
"从这里开始，只有集齐了\n"
"所有道馆徽章的训练家\l"
"才能进入。\p"
"训练家，请让我们确认\n"
"你是否拥有所有道馆徽章。$"

#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_PokemonLeague_1F/scripts.inc:129
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_PokemonLeague_1F_Text_HaventObtainedAllBadges"
msgid ""
"You haven't obtained all the BADGES.\p"
"If you're bound for the POKéMON\n"
"LEAGUE, you must return with them.$"
msgstr ""
"你还没有集齐所有的徽章。\p"
"如果你想挑战宝可梦联盟，\n"
"就请集齐后再来吧。$"

#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_PokemonLeague_1F/scripts.inc:134
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_PokemonLeague_1F_Text_GoForth"
msgid ""
"TRAINER! Believe in yourself and your\n"
"POKéMON, and go forth!$"
msgstr ""
"训练家！相信你自己和\n"
"你的宝可梦，前进吧！$"
